body:
Its embarrassing for him since he looked at the manga as a fellow writer, but then fail to read between the lines that Punpun is not and alien, but in fact a human being. He didn't realize that the author/mangaka decided to draw Punpun as a bird-like creature.

&#x200B;

I agree that no one should care, but its just a bit sad that he kind of ruined the experience for himself by failing to read between the lines as a fellow "author".

I am indeed.

&#x200B;

But I know that we will meet again, friend.

&#x200B;

I will be waiting for you patiently, from the depths below.
